    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);\nSetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndMemo);\nContinue()@Message(EndMemo);\nShowValuableMemo(WanderingNotesPage2);",
    "Description": "貴重品便籤",
    "links": [3]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 3,
    "actorID": "MC22",
    "text": "[panel=1]「[em7]一頁一頁翻，翻到末尾停住[/em7]，他過不去的地方，咱們過去。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC22,pic=8);",
    "zh_CN": "[panel=1]「[em7]一页一页翻，翻到末尾停住[/em7]，他过不去的地方，咱们过去。」",
    "links": [4]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 4,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「門後幾重機關？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=14);",
    "zh_CN": "「门后几重机关？」",
    "links": [5]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 5,
    "actorID": "MC22",
    "text": "[panel=1]「五重。他過了兩重——第三重傷了左臂，退出去，就躺在這裡，七天。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC22,pic=1);",
    "zh_CN": "[panel=1]「五重。他过了两重——第三重伤了左臂，退出去，就躺在这里，七天。」",
    "links": [6]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 6,
    "actorID": "MC22",
    "text": "[panel=1]「[em7]低頭看了一眼腰間那面盤[/em7]，他寫，盤在這谷裡轉得發狂——到第七日，忽然靜了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC22,pic=8);",
    "zh_CN": "[panel=1]「[em7]低头看了一眼腰间那面盘[/em7]，他写，盘在这谷里转得发狂——到第七日，忽然静了。」",
    "links": [7]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 7,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「妳這一路呢？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "zh_CN": "「你这一路呢？」",
    "links": [8]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 8,
    "actorID": "MC22",
    "text": "[panel=1]「一下也沒動。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC22,pic=1);",
    "zh_CN": "[panel=1]「一下也没动。」",
    "links": [9]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 9,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「末尾寫什麼？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=14);",
    "zh_CN": "「末尾写什么？」",
    "links": [10]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 10,
    "actorID": "MC22",
    "text": "[panel=1]「一個字。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC22,pic=14);",
    "zh_CN": "[panel=1]「一个字。」",
    "links": [11]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 11,
    "actorID": "MC22",
    "text": "[panel=1]「『北。』」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC22,pic=8);",
    "zh_CN": "[panel=1]「『北。』」",
    "links": [12]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 12,
    "actorID": "role2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（她把卷末那片空白摸了一遍。收進懷裡。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "zh_CN": "[panel=6]＊（她把卷末那片空白摸了一遍。收进怀里。）＊",
    "links": [13]
  },
